Slotted array capacity
How many tuples can we fit (completely) in a 8KB unspanned slotted page array with a 100B header and slot references of 3B each. (integers take 4 bytes each)
TYPE videogame = RECORD
  ID : CHAR(20);     
  Console  : CHAR(6);
  Price : INT;
END
-(#Tuples?)->
8KB Page[Header, ref, ref, ref, ref, ..., rec, rec, rec, rec]
floor((8000-100)/((20+6+4)+3))=239
